{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I awoke in a world I didn't recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I remember nothing about myself, but I can use magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out searching for an exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious journey of the \u201cCrimson Witch\u201d begins...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D side-scrolling action game where you control a witch who has lost her memory, traveling through a mysterious world. Defeat the monsters that appear using attack magic.Collect souls from defeated monsters to purchase items or enhance your attack magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by helping or being helped by the \u201cghosts\u201d you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses lie in wait ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the witch \u201cPurple,\u201d who looks just like you, friend or foe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what are the true memories of the amnesiac \u201cCrimson Witch\u201d?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, press the \u201cF1 key\u201d to configure your key bindings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changes made in \u201cControl Settings\u201d will not be reflected in button labels for text or other elements within the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To exit the game, close the window using [x] or press [Alt+F4].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Pixel Game Maker Series&quot; is a series of games created using the action game creation software &quot;Pixel Game Maker MV&quot; that can be enjoyed on the Nintendo Switch\u2122.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125970?t=1762912642","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125970?t=1762912642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125970/22768da702e542f1089534dfacd1373dd52d463c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762912642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125970/22768da702e542f1089534dfacd1373dd52d463c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762912642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I awoke in a world I didn't recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I remember nothing about myself, but I can use magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out searching for an exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious journey of the \u201cCrimson Witch\u201d begins...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D side-scrolling action game where you control a witch who has lost her memory, traveling through a mysterious world. Defeat the monsters that appear using attack magic.Collect souls from defeated monsters to purchase items or enhance your attack magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by helping or being helped by the \u201cghosts\u201d you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses lie in wait ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the witch \u201cPurple,\u201d who looks just like you, friend or foe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what are the true memories of the amnesiac \u201cCrimson Witch\u201d?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, press the \u201cF1 key\u201d to configure your key bindings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changes made in \u201cControl Settings\u201d will not be reflected in button labels for text or other elements within the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To exit the game, close the window using [x] or press [Alt+F4].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Pixel Game Maker Series&quot; is a series of games created using the action game creation software &quot;Pixel Game Maker MV&quot; that can be enjoyed on the Nintendo Switch\u2122.</p>","developers":["KIMAMASEISAKUSYO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125970/0f69fdb0104a4c5ffe5a00af1c1d9c599ff0e3b3/header.jpg?t=1762912642","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 KIMAMASEISAKUSYO Published by Gotcha Gotcha Games","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125970/1616630897/e5a41243b4a31491524dde76a652b55095d3950c/1761123927/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762912639","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125970/1616630897/e5a41243b4a31491524dde76a652b55095d3950c/1761123927/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762912639","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125970/1616630897/e5a41243b4a31491524dde76a652b55095d3950c/1761123927/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762912639","id":257220947,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220947/movie480.mp4?t=1762912639","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220947/movie_max.mp4?t=1762912639"},"name":"stray witch pv_j","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220947/cb7a3e3d577e89203b6747caf52d9895aa718f44/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762912639","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220947/movie480.webm?t=1762912639","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220947/movie_max.webm?t=1762912639"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125970/832297790/28b99cf54711c43c36ba947888a753f06ae66950/1761122346/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762912641","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steam